This directory contains initial conditions designed to compare the evolution of the SIDM simulations with CDM counterparts. 

./run.sh runs an SIDM simulation for ~400Myr with an interaction cross section of 100 cm^2/g.
./run_cdm.sh runs identical ICs with CDM particles.

plot_energy.py checks that the total (kinetic + potential) energy of the SIDM run is
conserved as the core forms, using the snapshots in snap/ and, if present, comparing
with the CDM run in snap_cdm/ (gravity alone does not conserve energy exactly).
run.sh calls it at the end; run run_cdm.sh first to include the CDM comparison.
